  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "**BODMAS rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b4ae5e38c4837a4e5fad38036d4e9c4f5ec902325054f6f26e269365ad507296.png] \n\nOption 1) 5 and 6\n\nAfter interchanging the digits we get: \n\n⇒ 37 + 1162 × __**8 ÷ 758**__ - 47 = 22\n\n⇒ 37 + __**1162 × 0.010**__ - 47 = 22\n\n⇒ __**37 + 12.26**__ - 47 = 22\n\n⇒ __**49.26 - 47**__ = 22\n\n⇒ 2.26 ≠ 22\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nOption 2) 4 and 5\n\nAfter interchanging the digits we get: \n\n⇒ 37 + 1142 × __**8 ÷ 768 **__- 57 = 22\n\n⇒ 37 + __**1142 × 0.010**__ - 57 = 22\n\n⇒ __**37 + 11.42**__ - 57 = 22\n\n⇒ __**48.42 - 57**__ = 22\n\n⇒ -8.58 ≠ 22\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n__***Option 3) 3 and 4***__\n\nAfter interchanging the digits we get:\n\n⇒ 47 + 1152 × __**8 ÷ 768 **__- 37 = 22\n\n⇒ 47 + 1152 × (8)/(768) - 37 = 22\n\n⇒ 47 + 3 × (8)/(2) - 37 = 22\n\n⇒ __**47 + 12 **__- 37 = 22\n\n⇒ **__59 - 37__** = 22\n\n⇒** 22 = 22**\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 4) 2 and 3\n\nAfter interchanging the digits we get:\n\n⇒ 27 + 1152 × __**8 ÷ 768 **__− 47 = 22\n\n⇒ 27 + __**1152 × 0.010**__ - 47 = 22\n\n⇒ __**27 + 11.52 **__- 47 = 22\n\n⇒ 38.52 - 47 = 22 \n\n⇒ - 8.48 ≠ 22\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"3 and 4\".**",
